{{- /*
  base.gohtml renders every full faq page through infodancer/ui's Layer 2
  ui/document, so the chrome (nav, footer, meta, CSS, analytics, theme,
  sidebars) is owned by ui and skinned per request by the host via Config.Chrome.
  The page template supplies the {{define "content"}} block; the faq chrome
  partial supplies the title/head blocks; the embedded ui.DocumentData on the
  view supplies ui/document's chrome fields.
*/ -}}
{{ template "ui/document" . }}
